Twee3-webstorm

The inherited Twee language support, grammar and porting references are based on
work by Cyrus Firheir, copyright (c) 2020, distributed under the MIT License.
The full original notice and permission terms are retained in LICENSE and are
included in the native plugin archive as META-INF/LICENSE.

The repository retains inherited VS Code/Vue sources for reference and baseline
characterization. Those runtimes are not intended to ship in the native plugin.
Tweego and Harlowe are separately installed tools; their binaries and story
format distributions are not bundled by this project.
